        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVWIN19ENTR, Single Cylinder Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Set Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is a uniquely ornate knob that brings sophistication and whimsy to any door. As a single cylinder entryset set, it has a Schlage C keyway-- one of the most common and secure--for your piece of mind. The Single Cylinder Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/windsor-knob-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favwin19\"><b> Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVWIN19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262395\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVWIN19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
